| project | before | after |
|---|---|---|
| kotoba-lang/dsl-core | `08f14d07` | `7f6d44a1` |
| kotoba-lang/async | `2b62d144` | `44848db4` |

`nbb scripts/advance-pins.cljs kotoba-lang <list> --execute` で当該 entry のみ書き換え、
`nbb scripts/verify-west-pins.cljs --only dsl-core` / `--only async` が両方とも
